<%- layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>

<main class="page-wrapper">

    <!-- header -->
    <section class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">
            Your privacy is important to us. This policy explains how we handle your data.
        </p>
    </section>

    <!-- content -->
    <section class="page-content">

        <div class="page-block">
            <h4 class="page-block-title">1. Information We Collect</h4>
            <p class="page-text">
                We collect basic information such as name, email address, and
                book details provided by users while using the platform.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="page-block">
            <h4 class="page-block-title">2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
            <p class="page-text">
                Your information is used to operate the platform, connect users,
                and improve overall user experience.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="page-block">
            <h4 class="page-block-title">3. Data Sharing</h4>
            <p class="page-text">
                BookLoop does not sell or share personal information with third
                parties, except when required by law.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="page-block">
            <h4 class="page-block-title">4. Data Security</h4>
            <p class="page-text">
                We take reasonable measures to protect user data, but no online
                platform can guarantee complete security.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="page-block">
            <h4 class="page-block-title">5. User Control</h4>
            <p class="page-text">
                Users can update or remove their information by managing their
                account settings or contacting support.
            </p>
        </div>

    </section>

</main>
